   Roles are tied to the person's VUS account ID (see roleIds/ and
   userProfiles/ in ChatBackend), NOT their display name and NOT their
   connection. Leaving, disconnecting, renaming, logging out and back in --
   none of it removes a role. Only an explicit removal (/remove, the staff
   menu, or a temporary grant expiring) does.
